{title: 025 - Praise the Lord, His Glories Show}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #025 • LLANFAIR • 11.11.10.11}
{lyricist: Henry Francis Lyte}
{composer: Robert Williams}
{key: F}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 25}
{meta: tune LLANFAIR}
{meta: meter 11.11.10.11}
{meta: category Worship - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[F]Praise the [Dm]Lord, His [Am]glories [C]show, [Am]Allelu [F/C]ia!
[Bb]Saints within [F]His courts [Dm]below, [Am]Allelu [C]ia!
[Am]Angles [F]'round His throne [Bb]above, [F]Allelu-ia!
[Bb]All that [Gm]see and [C]share [F]His love. Allelu [C]ia!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[F]Earth to [Dm]heaven [Am]and [Bb]heaven [C]to [Am]earth, [Gm]Alleluia!
[Bb]Tell [F]His wonders, [Dm]sing His [Am]worth, [Bb]Alleluia!
[Am]Age [Gm]to [F]age and shore [Bb]to [F]shore, Alleluia!
[Bb]Praise Him, [Gm]praise Him [C]evermore! [F]Alleluia!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[F]Praise the [Dm]Lord, His [Bb]mercies [C]trace, [Gm]Alleluia!
[Bb]Praise [F]His providence [Dm]and [Am]grace, [Bb]Alleluia!
[Am]All [Gm]that [F]He for man [Bb]hath [F]done, Alleluia!
[Bb]All He [Gm]sends us [C]through [F]His Son. Alleluia!
{end_of_verse}
